## Hyperledger Fabric (orderer patch)

[`rebroadcast/orderer-patch/fabric-v2.5.14-migration.patch`](rebroadcast/orderer-patch/fabric-v2.5.14-migration.patch)
is a modification of [Hyperledger Fabric](https://github.com/hyperledger/fabric)
v2.5.14, which is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The patch
changes two Fabric source files:

- `orderer/common/msgprocessor/expiration.go`
- `orderer/consensus/etcdraft/chain.go`

The patch contains unchanged context lines from those files as well as the
changes. The patch, and any orderer binary or image built from it, are licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0, in
[`rebroadcast/orderer-patch/LICENSE`](rebroadcast/orderer-patch/LICENSE). Fabric's
notice is reproduced in [`rebroadcast/orderer-patch/NOTICE`](rebroadcast/orderer-patch/NOTICE).
[`rebroadcast/orderer-patch/Dockerfile`](rebroadcast/orderer-patch/Dockerfile) builds
on the unmodified `hyperledger/fabric-orderer:2.5.14` image, also Apache-2.0.

