`rebroadcast/package-lock.json`, and the Go toolchain fetches the sample
chaincodes' modules when they are built. Each package's license files are
distributed with the package source that the package manager fetches.

The dependencies are licensed under MIT, Apache-2.0, ISC, BSD-2-Clause,
