## Software the sample scripts download

The scripts under `sample/` and `scripts/` download software into the user's own
environment. It is not part of this repository:

- Hyperledger Fabric release binaries and container images, `fabric-samples`,
  Fabric CA, CouchDB, hlf-operator (Hyperledger Bevel), Istio, kubectl, Helm and
  eksctl are licensed under Apache-2.0.
- Node.js is licensed under MIT.
- The Java migration-contract compile check (`scripts/compile-migration-stubs.sh`)
  fetches `fabric-chaincode-shim`, `fabric-protos` (Apache-2.0) and Gson
  (Apache-2.0) through Maven, in the `maven:3-eclipse-temurin-21` image.
